  Why is the human version is "v1.0.2"?  What happened to v1.0.1?

  The released v1.0.0 software was in fact not buildable; this is the first buildable version.

  Also.

  When the commit to SimpleSal of v1.0.1 was performed, an error was made by the human operator.

  When data begins to exist, it also begins to degrade, disintegrate, and experience entropy.

  Nevertheless.

  The collection of software and documents within SimpleSal, and a collection of SimpleSal Apps
  that make use of the software, are considered to be coherent.  A collection worthy of support.

